    <!-- HERO -->
    <header class="site-hero" aria-labelledby="shipping-title">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="kicker">Shipping &amp; Delivery</div>
          <h1 id="shipping-title">Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</h1>
          <p class="lead">This Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy explains how we handle order processing, shipping methods, delivery estimates, tracking, international shipments, customs, insurance, failed deliveries and liability. It aims to be transparent about expectations and responsibilities for both JOOD and our customers.</p>
          <p class="muted-small"><strong>Effective date:</strong> 1 January 2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/customer/images/shipping/shipping.png" alt="Shipping and delivery illustration">
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- POLICY CONTENT -->
    <section aria-label="Shipping policy content">
      <div class="grid">
        <div>
          <article class="card" aria-labelledby="policy-heading">
            <h2 id="policy-heading">Order processing &amp; cut-off times</h2>
            <p class="muted">Orders are processed during our business hours. Most orders are processed within <strong>24–48 hours</strong> of confirmed payment. Orders placed on weekends or public holidays will begin processing on the next business day. Processing times may be extended for high-value orders, custom items, or orders requiring additional verification.</p>

            <h3 id="shipping-methods">Shipping methods &amp; carriers</h3>
            <p class="muted">We offer multiple shipping options depending on destination and product type:</p>
            <ul class="value-list muted">
              <li><strong>Standard shipping:</strong> Cost-effective option with reliable delivery windows.</li>
              <li><strong>Express shipping:</strong> Faster delivery for urgent needs (higher fee).</li>
              <li><strong>Courier / same-day delivery:</strong> Available in selected cities and for eligible products.</li>
              <li><strong>Freight / pallet delivery:</strong> For bulky or heavy items; special handling and appointment delivery applies.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="muted">We partner with reputable regional and international couriers. Carrier selection is made based on price, speed and geographic reliability. Carrier details and tracking numbers are provided in dispatch emails.</p>

            <h3 id="estimates">Estimated delivery times</h3>
            <p class="muted">Delivery estimates shown at checkout are indicative and depend on product availability, destination and selected shipping method. Typical estimates (after dispatch):</p>
            <table class="table" role="table" aria-label="Estimated delivery times">
              <thead>
                <tr><th>Service</th><th>Domestic (UAE)</th><th>Gulf region</th><th>International (standard)</th></tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><td>Standard</td><td>2–5 business days</td><td>3–7 business days</td><td>7–21 business days</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Express</td><td>Next business day — 2 days</td><td>2–4 business days</td><td>3–7 business days</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Freight / bulky</td><td>3–10 business days (appointment)</td><td>5–15 business days</td><td>Varies by carrier &amp; customs</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
            <p class="muted note">Estimates exclude processing time and are subject to customs clearance for international shipments. During sales, peak seasons and adverse conditions, estimated times may increase.</p>

            <h3 id="tracking">Tracking &amp; notifications</h3>
            <p class="muted">Once your order ships you will receive a dispatch email with a tracking number and link. Real-time tracking depends on the courier — updates may have short delays. Use the <a href="/customer/track-order">Track Order</a> page or the courier portal to view the latest status.</p>

            <h3 id="failed-delivery">Failed delivery attempts &amp; customer responsibilities</h3>
            <p class="muted">If the courier cannot deliver, they may attempt re-delivery or leave instructions for collection. Customers should:</p>
            <ul class="value-list muted">
              <li>Provide accurate delivery details at checkout and update address promptly if changes are required (notify support immediately).</li>
              <li>Monitor tracking and contact support if delivery appears delayed or stuck.</li>
              <li>Collect shipments promptly from depot if instructed; failed collections may result in return to sender and additional fees.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 id="address-change">Changing delivery address</h3>
            <p class="muted">Address changes are possible only while the order status is <strong>Processing</strong>. Once shipped, updates depend on the courier and may not be possible. Contact support immediately with order number and new address — we will liaise with the courier but cannot guarantee success after dispatch.</p>

            <h3 id="signature">Signature &amp; proof of delivery</h3>
            <p class="muted">Certain deliveries require a signature on receipt for proof of delivery. For contact-free deliveries, couriers may leave parcels in a safe place and mark as delivered. If you did not receive a parcel marked as delivered, contact support immediately with details and any photo evidence (e.g., porch camera).</p>

            <h3 id="lost-damaged">Lost or damaged shipments</h3>
            <p class="muted">Report lost or damaged items within <strong>48 hours</strong> of delivery status or discovery. Provide photos, packaging details and order number. For damaged items, keep packaging and all components for inspection. We will investigate with the carrier and — where applicable — arrange replacement, repair or refund in line with our Returns &amp; Refunds Policy.</p>

            <h3 id="insurance">Shipping insurance &amp; declared value</h3>
            <p class="muted">High-value items may be shipped with insurance or require a declared value. Insurance coverage terms vary by carrier. If you require additional coverage, contact our support team prior to dispatch to discuss options (additional fees may apply).</p>

            <h3 id="international-shipping">International shipping, customs &amp; duties</h3>
            <p class="muted">For international orders:</p>
            <ul class="value-list muted">
              <li>Import duties, taxes and customs clearance fees are generally the responsibility of the recipient unless the checkout price includes DDP (Delivered Duty Paid).</li>
              <li>Customs processing can delay delivery; carriers and customs authorities can request additional documentation from the recipient.</li>
              <li>Returns from international destinations may require specific documentation — follow the instructions provided by our Returns Team to avoid customs complications.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 id="exceptions">Service exceptions &amp; force majeure</h3>
            <p class="muted">We are not liable for delays caused by events outside our reasonable control (e.g., extreme weather, natural disasters, carrier strikes, customs delays, changes to transport rules). In such cases, we will work with carriers to restore service and notify affected customers.</p>

            <h3 id="surcharges">Fuel surcharges &amp; remote area fees</h3>
            <p class="muted">From time to time carriers apply fuel surcharges or remote-area delivery fees. If applicable, these fees will be displayed at checkout or communicated prior to dispatch for bulky/bespoke shipments.</p>

            <h3 id="delivery-policies">Special delivery requirements (installation &amp; appointments)</h3>
            <p class="muted">Bulky, heavy or installation-required products may be delivered by specialist teams and require an appointment. Delivery personnel may assist with placement but do not perform installation unless explicitly contracted. Please confirm site access and any special instructions at order time.</p>

            <h3 id="dispute-resolution">Dispute handling &amp; escalation</h3>
            <p class="muted">If you believe a delivery was mishandled, open a support ticket with order number, tracking and evidence (photos, timestamps). We will liaise with carriers and provide updates. For escalations, our Customer Experience Team will acknowledge within 24 hours and aim to resolve within 10 business days.</p>

            <h3 id="data">Personal data &amp; delivery</h3>
            <p class="muted">We share limited personal data (name, address, phone, email) with carriers to enable delivery. We process this data in accordance with our <a href="/customer/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>. For specific data requests related to shipping, contact dpo@jood.com.</p>

            <h3 id="changes">Policy updates</h3>
            <p class="muted">We may update this Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy to reflect changes in operations, carriers, or legal requirements. Significant changes will be published with an updated effective date.</p>

            <h2 id="contact">Contact &amp; shipping support</h2>
            <p class="muted">For shipping queries, tracking issues, or to request assistance, contact our Shipping &amp; Logistics team. When contacting us include your order number, tracking number (if available) and a clear description of the issue.</p>

            <div style="margin-top:10px" class="muted">
              <p><strong>Support email:</strong> <a href="mailto:shipping@jood.com">shipping@jood.com</a> (or <a href="mailto:support@jood.com">support@jood.com</a>)</p>
              <p><strong>Phone:</strong> +971-55-555-5555 (choose shipping option)</p>
              <p><strong>Postal address:</strong> Al Reem Tower, Dubai, UAE</p>
            </div>

            <p class="note">This Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy is intended as an operational guide. It does not create contractual rights beyond any express terms in your order confirmation. For business or bulk shipments, bespoke agreements may supersede parts of this policy — please refer to your contract or contact our B2B team.</p>
          </article>
        </div>

