            <h3>Need assistance?</h3>
            <div class="contact-card">
              <div class="contact-meta">
                <p class="muted"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:shipping@jood.com">shipping@jood.com</a></p>
                <p class="muted"><strong>Phone:</strong> +971-55-555-5555</p>
                <p class="muted"><strong>Address:</strong> Al Reem Tower, Dubai, UAE</p>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-actions">
                <a class="btn-primary" href="/customer/contact-us">Open a support ticket</a>
                <p class="muted-small" style="margin-top:10px">For urgent safety or fraud reports call the support line and select the emergency option.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #eef2f7;margin:12px 0" />

            <h3>Carrier performance</h3>
            <p class="muted">We regularly review carrier performance and publish updates to our courier partners to maintain high delivery standards. For persistent carrier-related issues, contact our Shipping Team to escalate.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
